### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### List connections
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections

### Get policy
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections/{{id}}/policy

### Structured query (no LLM)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections/{{id}}/query/structured
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "table": "tasks",
  "columns": ["id", "title", "status", "priority"],
  "filters": [{"column": "status", "op": "=", "value": "TODO"}],
  "order_by": [{"column": "id", "direction": "asc"}],
  "limit": 20,
  "dry_run": false
}

### Guarded raw SQL (SELECT only)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections/{{id}}/query/sql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sql": "SELECT id, title, status FROM tasks WHERE status = 'TODO'",
  "dry_run": false
}

### Natural language query (requires LLM_API_KEY in .env)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections/{{id}}/query/nl
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "查出所有状态是 TODO 的任务，只返回 id、title、status",
  "dry_run": false
}

### Dry-run NL (preview SQL only)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections/{{id}}/query/nl
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "统计每个负责人有多少任务",
  "dry_run": true
}
